# The offline Postgres + PostGIS + pgvector image every database-backed test arm
# boots. This file is the ONE place the tag is written, because its consumers do
# not share a language: `src/postgres-image.ts` reads it for the two TypeScript
# fixtures, `scripts/local-gates/db-fresh-schema.sh` sources it as bash, and
# `apps/agent/src/animichi/tests/conftest_db.py` reads it for the Python offline
# arm. `test/image-tag-contract.test.ts` resolves the TypeScript and bash reads
# and fails on drift; the Python consumer's own contract lives in
# `apps/agent/src/animichi/tests/unit/test_conftest_db_image_tag.py`.
#
# Build it once (the only step that needs network):
#   docker build -f packages/test-postgres/Dockerfile -t <this tag> .
TEST_POSTGRES_IMAGE=animichi-test-postgres:18-3.6-pgvector-0.8.5
